('tracker', 'Heroes', 'Oath tracker, days 15-30: mark each kept day. Repair what broke.', ['Day 15 — kept?', 'Day 16 — kept?', 'Day 17 — kept?', 'Day 18 — kept?', 'Day 19 — kept?', 'Day 20 — kept?', 'Day 21 — kept?', 'Day 22 — kept?', 'Day 23 — kept?', 'Day 24 — kept?', 'Day 25 — kept?', 'Day 26 — kept?', 'Day 27 — kept?', 'Day 28 — kept? / Day 29-30 + repair note']),
